§ `ss 3 to 5`

#ASSERT `the conduct is an offence` `kidnapping for ransom`
#ASSERT `the conduct is an offence` `receiving the ransom knowingly`
#ASSERT `the conduct is an offence` `negotiating to obtain the ransom`
#ASSERT `the conduct is an offence` `paying the ransom`
#ASSERT `the conduct is an offence` `lending money to the family to pay the ransom`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct is an offence` `reporting the kidnapping to the police`

#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `kidnapping for ransom` EQUALS "death or life imprisonment"
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `receiving the ransom knowingly` EQUALS "10 years and caning"
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `negotiating to obtain the ransom` EQUALS "10 years and caning"
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `paying the ransom` EQUALS "7 years and a fine"
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `lending money to the family to pay the ransom` EQUALS "7 years and a fine"
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence` `reporting the kidnapping to the police` EQUALS "none"

